sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff
  actor Reporter
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant TS as Ticket Service
  participant Dept as Department Service
  participant PG as PostgreSQL

  Staff->>GW: POST /tickets/{id}/start
  GW->>TS: gRPC GetTicketHistory for permission check
  TS->>PG: Load ticket and history
  PG-->>TS: Ticket with department and version
  TS-->>GW: Ticket data
  Note over GW: Allow active staff in the assigned department
  GW->>TS: gRPC StartProgress with expected version
  TS->>PG: Transaction sets IN_PROGRESS and writes history plus outbox
  PG-->>TS: Commit successful
  TS-->>GW: IN_PROGRESS
  GW-->>Staff: Work started

  Staff->>GW: POST /tickets/{id}/resolve with completion photos
  GW->>TS: gRPC GetTicketHistory for permission check
  TS->>PG: Load ticket and current version
  PG-->>TS: Ticket data
  TS-->>GW: Ticket data
  GW->>TS: gRPC ResolveTicket with photo URLs and expected version
  TS->>PG: Require 1 to 5 photos and status IN_PROGRESS
  TS->>PG: Transaction sets RESOLVED and writes history plus outbox
  PG-->>TS: Commit successful
  TS-->>GW: RESOLVED
  GW-->>Staff: Resolution submitted

  Reporter->>GW: POST /tickets/{id}/confirm or POST /tickets/{id}/reopen
  GW->>TS: gRPC GetTicketHistory for ownership check
  TS->>PG: Load ticket and current version
  PG-->>TS: Ticket data
  TS-->>GW: Ticket data
  alt Reporter confirms resolution
    GW->>TS: gRPC ConfirmResolution with expected version
    TS->>PG: Transaction sets CLOSED and writes history plus outbox
    PG-->>TS: Commit successful
    TS-->>GW: CLOSED
    GW-->>Reporter: Resolution confirmed
  else Reporter reopens with reason
    GW->>TS: gRPC ReopenTicket with reason and expected version
    TS->>Dept: GET /departments/{id} for notification recipient
    Dept-->>TS: Department contact details
    TS->>PG: Transaction sets IN_PROGRESS and writes history plus outbox
    PG-->>TS: Commit successful
    TS-->>GW: IN_PROGRESS
    GW-->>Reporter: Ticket reopened
  end
